<title>JAPAN: Oman raises Aug crude price to $19.60 - traders.</title>
<headline>Oman raises Aug crude price to $19.60 - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman raised the price of its August-lifting crude oil by 83 cents per barrel to $19.60 from the July price of $18.77, oil traders said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
